WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.480
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.480
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:17.810
<i>Lord Girodelle said this to Master,</i>

00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:19.580
<i>''Please allow me to marry your daughter.''</i>

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:22.460
<i>And the Master's reply was,</i>

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:26.420
<i>''What a splendid proposal!
You have my blessing!''</i>

00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:39.130
Marriage?

00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:39.800
Me?

00:00:40.470 --> 00:00:43.270
With Girodelle, who was my
subordinate until recently?

00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:45.170
Father gave his blessings?

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:48.340
Just how did this all come together?

