00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:32.800
episode

00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:32.800
"You are

00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:32.800
the Light,

00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:32.800
I am the Shadow"

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:38.640
Did you call for me, Your Excellency?

00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:41.540
Oh, General Jarjayes, please come in.

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:44.890
Well? Are things going well?

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:47.350
Yes, everything is well.

00:02:47.350 --> 00:02:51.960
I hear your son... ah, daughter was
transferred to the French Guards?

00:02:51.960 --> 00:02:52.490
Yes...

00:02:52.490 --> 00:02:55.030
Is she doing well? Oscar, I mean...

00:02:55.030 --> 00:02:55.760
Well...

00:02:55.390 --> 00:02:56.800
Your Excellency, General Bouillé.

00:02:56.800 --> 00:02:58.730
It's almost time for the Garden Party.

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:00.930
Tell them I'll be late.

00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:04.270
I have a complicated matter I must
discuss with General Jarjayes.

00:03:04.270 --> 00:03:05.240
Certainly.

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:08.040
A complicated matter?

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:12.920
I was told the troops are blatantly
expressing their dissatisfaction.

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:16.450
They're saying they aren't able to work sufficiently
if their commander is a woman.

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:19.280
Some have even gone as far as
writing a letter to His Majesty.

00:03:19.280 --> 00:03:21.190
Don't get me wrong.

00:03:21.190 --> 00:03:24.890
I know Oscar is far more capable
than any average officer.

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:28.060
However, military morale
is dependant on teamwork.

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:30.860
Furthermore, the French Guards
are on an important mission,

00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:32.730
patrolling the streets of Paris on special alert.

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:33.860
General Bouillé!

00:03:32.930 --> 00:03:33.860
Especially, at such a crucial time...

00:03:34.170 --> 00:03:37.400
I am currently urging my daughter to get married.

00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:44.990
As her father, I feel it's time for her
to take her leave as a military officer.

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:58.380
「   Saint-Just   」

00:03:58.820 --> 00:03:59.860
Pardon me!

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:02.340
Am I correct to assume you
are Marquis de Mardennes?!

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:05.850
Indeed, I am de Mardennes, the Treasury Secretary.
What is it you want?

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:08.810
Forgive my rudeness,
but I've come to take your life!

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:09.810
What?!

00:04:22.510 --> 00:04:24.580
Did you call for me, Monsieur Robespierre?

00:04:25.020 --> 00:04:28.530
Are you the one who assassinated
Marquis de Mardennes, Saint-Just?

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:34.580
I told you to lodge a complaint to Marquis de Mardennes
for his oppressive rule over the farmers on his land,

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:36.010
but I didn't tell you to kill him!

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:38.530
I lodged a thorough complaint.

00:04:38.530 --> 00:04:40.400
But he wouldn't listen.

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:41.230
Is that true?

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:42.630
Did you really speak to him?

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:43.770
Of course.

00:04:43.770 --> 00:04:48.600
However, instead of repenting, he threatened to
have me arrested, so he left me no choice.

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:51.010
So what if I did though?

00:04:51.010 --> 00:04:52.810
The nobility are the enemy of the people.

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:54.190
Those were your exact words, Monsieur.

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:56.680
Even so, your methods are too extreme.

00:04:57.420 --> 00:04:59.140
I'll be careful next time then.

00:05:03.520 --> 00:05:04.820
Oh, that's right. Bernard.

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:07.780
I could really use your help sometime.

00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:12.210
I'll soon need that brilliant talent
you displayed as the Black Knight.

00:05:17.570 --> 00:05:22.590
Bernard, I'm concerned...
about his icy madness...

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:25.600
French Guards Barracks

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:27.430
Alain de Soissons.

00:05:27.780 --> 00:05:28.510
Here.

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:30.450
Jules Rosselois.

00:05:30.450 --> 00:05:31.350
Here.

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:32.520
André Grandier.

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:33.790
Here!

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:35.090
Pierre Maurois.

00:05:35.090 --> 00:05:35.750
Here!

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:36.620
Louis Marot.

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:37.310
Here.

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:40.360
The men who I just called will go
on special patrol in Paris today.

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:46.060
Also, be sure to gather any information on Marquis
de Mardennes' assassination while on patrol.

00:05:46.060 --> 00:05:46.760
All clear?

00:05:46.760 --> 00:05:47.960
All right, go!

00:05:54.270 --> 00:05:56.830
Please forgive me for my abrupt
visit the other day.

00:05:57.240 --> 00:05:57.840
It's all right.

00:05:58.310 --> 00:06:00.670
I was hoping I could visit tonight.
What is your schedule?

00:06:01.050 --> 00:06:03.450
I'm on duty tonight, so I won't
be returning to my manor.

00:06:03.450 --> 00:06:04.300
Excuse me.

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:11.060
There are many terrorists lurking in Paris now.

00:06:11.060 --> 00:06:14.420
Please be careful, my Oscar François...

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:27.610
André.

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:28.410
Yeah?

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:29.340
Watch your back.

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:30.640
They're after you.

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:36.580
Everyone already knows you're that
female commander's servant.

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:40.960
Some are even saying you're
the Commander's spy.

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:44.450
Well, just be on the lookout when you're alone.

00:06:46.470 --> 00:06:48.850
「 Opera House 」

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:57.600
Pardon me. Are you Duke Monsabert?

00:07:00.170 --> 00:07:02.140
There's a Madame waiting for you in the hallway.

00:07:02.140 --> 00:07:05.230
Oh, I see. I'll go see her right now.

00:07:15.250 --> 00:07:15.830
Commander!

00:07:17.990 --> 00:07:21.000
Duke Monsabert was stabbed
at the Opera House just now!

00:07:21.530 --> 00:07:22.360
All right!

00:07:22.360 --> 00:07:23.960
All men, head to the Opera House!

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:26.920
Create an emergency cordon
around the Opera House!

00:07:31.320 --> 00:07:33.490
Hey! What are you doing?!

00:07:33.490 --> 00:07:34.490
To the Opera House!

00:07:34.490 --> 00:07:35.920
Head to the Opera House!

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:37.590
If you want to go, feel free.

00:07:37.590 --> 00:07:39.020
You're on your own, Commander.

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:42.730
Let the military police handle it.

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:44.170
It's almost time for dinner!

00:07:44.170 --> 00:07:45.720
We're starving over here!

00:08:05.720 --> 00:08:06.540
Father is...?

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:09.350
Yes, he's waiting for you in his study.

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:14.760
Father, there's something I'd like
to discuss with you, as well.

00:08:14.100 --> 00:08:15.970
Anyhow, have a seat.

00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:20.200
Please turn down Girodelle's proposal.

00:08:20.200 --> 00:08:23.000
I have absolutely no desire of getting married!

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:25.010
Now, stop being so irate about it.

00:08:25.010 --> 00:08:26.860
Let's discuss this matter calmly.

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:28.940
All right.

00:08:32.380 --> 00:08:35.170
I hear the French Guards are
full of hardships for you.

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:36.150
Hardships?

00:08:36.150 --> 00:08:38.590
I hardly consider them as hardships.

00:08:38.590 --> 00:08:42.330
A newly appointed commander will always face some sort
of pushback, regardless the squad they're assigned to.

00:08:43.050 --> 00:08:45.290
On the contrary, it's been
\han encouragement for me.

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:48.890
Things are much more interesting than the Royal
Guards where everything is complaisant.

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:52.970
Forgive me, Oscar...

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:54.140
Forgive your father...!

00:08:54.140 --> 00:08:58.900
Forgive me for not raising you as a woman and
providing you with the happiness of a woman!

00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:06.150
I have no right to say this after all this time,
but if I truly wished for your happiness,

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:08.780
I should have raised you a woman,
as you were meant to be...!

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:11.920
It was the biggest mistake of my life.

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:14.410
I made you endure unnecessary hardships...

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:20.960
Father, please don't worry.

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:26.170
I didn't abandon my womanhood
as much as you think.

00:09:26.170 --> 00:09:29.710
I even fell madly in love as a woman once.

00:09:32.470 --> 00:09:35.910
In fact, I'm very grateful to you, Father.

00:09:35.910 --> 00:09:38.150
Because you raised me as a man,

00:09:38.150 --> 00:09:42.050
I'm able to forget everything and live strongly.

00:09:45.450 --> 00:09:48.420
Oscar, don't say such sad things...

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:52.090
If you were hurt as a woman, I want you
to find your happiness as a woman.

00:09:52.090 --> 00:09:54.360
You mustn't run away, Oscar.

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:57.370
You mustn't deceive yourself
by calling yourself a man.

00:09:57.370 --> 00:09:59.400
You're a woman, after all.

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:03.540
You're my daughter who I can proudly send
anywhere and your beauty is second to none.

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:07.500
Anyhow, I want you to find your happiness
and make up for the lost time.

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:12.510
If Girodelle doesn't suit you,
I'll find you an even better suitor.

00:10:12.510 --> 00:10:16.470
Even General Bouillé is willing
to go out on a limb for you.

00:10:25.030 --> 00:10:26.230
Hey, André.

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:26.760
Yeah?

00:10:26.760 --> 00:10:27.850
You have a visitor.

00:10:28.700 --> 00:10:29.120
For me?

00:10:32.930 --> 00:10:33.840
Grandma!

00:10:33.840 --> 00:10:35.530
I brought your undergarments.

00:10:36.340 --> 00:10:38.070
Thanks! That'll help me out a lot!

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:42.240
Good grief, how could you join the French
Guards without discussing it with me?

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:43.540
So when is your break?

00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:46.010
You're coming back to the manor
during your break, right?

00:10:46.010 --> 00:10:47.680
Yeah, of course.

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:49.680
Once I'm on break,
I'll head straight back to the manor.

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:52.320
Plus, I'm starting to miss your cooking.

00:10:52.320 --> 00:10:54.120
The food here isn't that good.

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:55.490
Listen to yourself!

00:10:59.490 --> 00:11:00.500
Huh?

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:01.430
What's wrong, Grandma?

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:05.010
Well, I'm wondering whether
or not I should tell you...

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:06.560
Tell me what?

00:11:06.900 --> 00:11:08.400
Oh, I'll just tell you!

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:14.360
Well, you see, back at the manor, there are
talks about Our Lady getting married.

00:11:18.350 --> 00:11:19.640
I-I see...

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:38.730
Hey, nice timing. There's something
I want to talk to you about.

00:11:38.730 --> 00:11:39.420
Talk?

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:42.890
I heard you're that female commander's servant.

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:45.370
You scumbag!

00:11:45.370 --> 00:11:49.110
It really pisses me off when I see people
wagging their tails to please the nobles!

00:11:49.110 --> 00:11:50.080
Got that?!

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:51.990
Wagging his tail isn't the only thing he's doing.

00:11:51.990 --> 00:11:56.030
You slipped into our unit, so you can spy on us
and tell her everything and anything, right?

00:11:58.890 --> 00:12:01.860
Here, why don't you come to
the storage room with us?

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:08.950
I'll rough you up real good.

00:12:10.300 --> 00:12:11.600
Sounds interesting!

00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:13.670
I'm annoyed about something today, too!

00:12:14.440 --> 00:12:16.630
I'll gladly take you on!

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:17.710
What?!

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:31.460
Why you...!

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:40.010
A fight! A fight!

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:42.810
The new one-eyed recruit started a fight!

00:12:45.980 --> 00:12:47.180
They're fighting in Storage Number 4!

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:48.330
In the arsenal section!

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:59.790
Come on! Is that all you got?!

00:13:09.940 --> 00:13:10.470
Damn it...!

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:14.390
Bastard!

00:13:16.880 --> 00:13:18.170
Next up...!

00:13:33.130 --> 00:13:34.800
Hey, hey, hey...

00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:36.090
Why you...!

00:13:55.450 --> 00:13:56.580
Damn nobles' lapdog!

00:13:56.580 --> 00:13:58.950
Keep wagging that tail if you can!

00:13:58.950 --> 00:13:59.990
Come on, let's go.

00:13:59.990 --> 00:14:00.770
Yeah.

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:02.260
Move!

00:14:02.260 --> 00:14:03.380
Come on, move it!

00:14:06.190 --> 00:14:07.530
Hey, hey...

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:12.280
I'm your Squad Leader. You should know to
run it by me first, before you start a ruckus.

00:14:13.170 --> 00:14:14.570
Alain, you got it wrong.

00:14:14.570 --> 00:14:16.500
The fight broke out before I had the chance.

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:18.340
It's just a fight, all right?

00:14:18.340 --> 00:14:20.200
Oh, just a fight, eh?

00:14:20.740 --> 00:14:22.580
If it were just a fight that's even worse!

00:14:22.580 --> 00:14:24.410
Five against one doesn't sit well with me.

00:14:24.410 --> 00:14:25.380
Alain, don't!

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:26.250
I'll stop! I'll stop!

00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:27.310
No more!

00:14:27.310 --> 00:14:30.220
Good, as long as you understand.

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:31.750
And don't forget this.

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:34.190
That new one-eyed recruit
is my good drinking buddy.

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:35.290
Yeah, I won't forget.

00:14:35.290 --> 00:14:36.180
You got it.

00:14:39.960 --> 00:14:42.050
Sheesh, you sure got roughed up hard.

00:14:42.660 --> 00:14:44.060
Hey, André! Pull it together!

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:45.990
André?

00:14:46.930 --> 00:14:49.240
Oscar, don't...

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:51.670
Don't get married...

00:14:59.280 --> 00:15:00.610
I see...

00:15:00.610 --> 00:15:01.670
So that's what this is about.

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:05.630
What do you see in that manly woman anyway?

00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:08.020
Hey, Commander!

00:15:08.020 --> 00:15:10.090
You take care of this guy.

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:14.890
After all, this guy is willing
to throw his life away for you.

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:41.230
I'll escort you.

00:15:41.230 --> 00:15:42.670
No, please allow me to escort you.

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:48.970
I realized it after you left the Royal Guards.

00:15:48.970 --> 00:15:51.540
I realized I was always searching
for your pleasant voice and smile,

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:53.140
and how I used to follow your unclouded eyes...

00:15:53.740 --> 00:15:56.600
When I realized it, I could no longer
contain myself and told your father...

00:15:57.650 --> 00:15:59.060
...that I would like to marry you.

00:16:01.720 --> 00:16:03.650
I love you... with all my heart.

00:16:08.120 --> 00:16:11.720
It's so frustrating that I can only convey
it to you in such lackluster words.

00:16:17.260 --> 00:16:18.570
Please...

00:16:18.570 --> 00:16:20.250
Please say something.

00:16:23.600 --> 00:16:27.160
Ah, the winds are blowing through my heart...

00:16:38.420 --> 00:16:42.990
Being a noble holds many burdens,
but if I weren't born as one,

00:16:42.990 --> 00:16:45.940
I would have gladly become your
servant or even a stablehand.

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:52.330
As nobles, neither of us has any right
to speak about servants in such a way.

00:16:52.330 --> 00:16:53.740
Not you, nor I...

00:16:56.970 --> 00:16:57.810
Excuse me.

00:16:57.810 --> 00:16:59.740
You've escorted me far enough.

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:16.090
His Excellency, General Bouillé has offered
to host a party in your honor.

00:17:16.560 --> 00:17:19.090
All the young lords of Versailles
will be gathered there.

00:17:19.090 --> 00:17:21.100
They are all your suitors.

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:26.800
I order you as your father!

00:17:26.800 --> 00:17:29.770
You are to attend this party
wearing the finest dress and makeup,

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:32.530
as the daughter of the prestigious Jarjayes family!

00:17:36.010 --> 00:17:38.670
Oscar... To your happiness!

00:17:49.620 --> 00:17:52.490
Well? Did Oscar agree to do this?

00:17:52.490 --> 00:17:53.960
Yes... probably...

00:17:54.600 --> 00:17:55.430
All right!

00:17:55.430 --> 00:17:57.060
I'll bring in another orchestra...

00:17:57.060 --> 00:18:00.230
...and make it a ball that will amaze
even the Palace of Versailles!

00:18:00.230 --> 00:18:01.930
I greatly appreciate your gesture, General Bouillé.

00:18:02.570 --> 00:18:03.640
Are you certain?

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:07.610
Yes, I'm certain that carriage belongs to
General Bouillé, Chief General of the Army.

00:18:08.210 --> 00:18:08.770
Good!

00:18:42.110 --> 00:18:43.260
General Jarjayes!

00:18:43.980 --> 00:18:45.770
Hang in there!

00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:56.590
Father!

00:19:00.960 --> 00:19:02.920
He'll be all right, My Lady.

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:05.580
The bullet miraculously missed his heart.

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:23.070
Thank you, André...

00:19:28.660 --> 00:19:32.310
It seems the perpetrator mistook
me for General Bouillé.

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:36.530
I swear... I swear I'll capture the man
who shot you with my own hands.

00:19:37.100 --> 00:19:39.850
Oscar, if you're really worried about me,

00:19:39.850 --> 00:19:44.490
instead of capturing the culprit, it would please me more
to see you wear a wedding dress, the sooner the better.

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:51.250
The ball hosted by General Bouillé is tomorrow.

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:52.420
You'll go, won't you?

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:53.470
Yes.

00:19:55.850 --> 00:19:57.550
Hey, André.

00:19:57.550 --> 00:19:58.380
Yes?

00:19:58.890 --> 00:20:01.890
Make sure you accompany
Oscar to the ball tomorrow.

00:20:01.890 --> 00:20:03.820
This is a once in a lifetime opportunity,

00:20:03.820 --> 00:20:07.220
to show off just how beautiful Oscar is
to all the young lords at Versailles!

00:20:09.760 --> 00:20:10.560
Certainly.

00:20:15.100 --> 00:20:15.860
Come in.

00:20:20.840 --> 00:20:22.180
Oscar, let's go.

00:20:22.180 --> 00:20:23.280
It's almost time.

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:24.810
It's still early. Also...

00:20:24.810 --> 00:20:25.950
It's not early.

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:28.750
You need time to return to
the manor and get dressed.

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:29.460
Listen to me.

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:31.150
There's no need for you to accompany me.

00:20:32.590 --> 00:20:35.130
I promised Master I would accompany you.

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:36.090
It's fine!

00:20:36.090 --> 00:20:36.880
I don't need you to come!

00:20:45.240 --> 00:20:48.890
André, I won't be married off that easily.

00:20:59.950 --> 00:21:01.850
Oh, welcome.

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:06.590
I'm looking forward to seeing Oscar François
attend this occasion as a woman.

00:21:06.590 --> 00:21:07.820
But what a surprise.

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:11.160
Who would have thought there'd be so many
men who are interested in her at Versailles.

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:12.750
It's quite the competition.

00:21:36.930 --> 00:21:38.890
What a peculiar ball.

00:21:38.890 --> 00:21:41.150
Not one lady is in attendance.

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:45.590
It's certainly like her to do this.

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:51.170
Please excuse me.

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:54.040
It seems I am out of place here.

00:21:57.810 --> 00:21:58.980
Is that so...

00:21:58.980 --> 00:22:00.880
Oscar was wearing her military uniform...

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:02.110
I see...

00:22:03.610 --> 00:22:06.280
No, I won't say anything when she returns.

00:22:07.250 --> 00:22:11.150
It's also possible that she's right and I'm wrong.

00:22:11.150 --> 00:22:15.020
All I hope for is that Oscar... my daughter...

00:22:15.590 --> 00:22:20.700
....will never give up searching for her happiness.

00:22:20.700 --> 00:22:26.570
I worry, because ever since she was young, she was the kind of child that would suppress her feelings...

00:22:28.990 --> 00:22:33.620
To be continued

